        "title": "Add agentic ad lab run prompts and signup schemas to common",
        "summary": "The common package gains a dedicated module for agentic ad lab run instructions that mirrors Desktop's sponsored-run prompts into a Cloud VM context. New types in `agentic-ad-lab.ts` model the account-step state machine (`LabSignupStage`) and the sealed credential grants (`labSignupSecretSchema`) that the Cloud API handles. The single monolithic `LAB_RUN_GUIDANCE` string is removed in favor of granular exported constants such as `LAB_SPONSORED_SCOPE_GUIDANCE` and `LAB_DEFERRED_SIGNUP_LINK`.",
